  #line-at(90.024pt, 85.2pt, "insights for designing advanced multifunctional and multidimensional acoustic devices. ")
  #line-at(111.02pt, 103.1pt, "To fill these gaps, we propose two tight-binding models based on a modified ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 121.1pt, "Haldane model and leverage the layer degree of freedom to construct corresponding ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 138.98pt, "acoustic crystals. This approach bypasses the need for external fields or intricate 3D ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 156.98pt, "stacking. Our platform hosts symmetry-protected nodal lines coexisting with 2D ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 174.86pt, "antichiral surface states. Furthermore, building on this monolayer platform, the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 192.86pt, "introduction of unequal vertical interlayer couplings splits these nodal lines into Weyl ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 210.74pt, "points and induces a higher-order topological phase with 1D hinge states protected by ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 228.74pt, "bulk polarization. Thus, our platform thereby achieves multidimensional topological ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 246.62pt, "control through the concurrent utilization of 2D antichiral surface transport and 1D ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 264.62pt, "hinge transport, providing a concrete pathway from surface to hinge physics in acoustic ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 282.53pt, "systems. ")
